WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.544 --> 00:00:15.945
Jason ran into Kids Central.

2
00:00:15.946 --> 00:00:19.269
Today was Board Game day.

3
00:00:19.270 --> 00:00:23.370
"Did everyone bring a board game?" Miss Shelly asked.

4
00:00:23.371 --> 00:00:26.731
"I brought Land of Candy!" Izzie said.

5
00:00:26.732 --> 00:00:29.516
Nina laughed.

6
00:00:29.517 --> 00:00:33.360
"That game always makes me hungry."

7
00:00:33.361 --> 00:00:35.561
"I brought chess."

8
00:00:35.562 --> 00:00:38.154
Bobby started setting up the board.

9
00:00:38.155 --> 00:00:40.588
"Who wants to try and beat me?"

10
00:00:40.589 --> 00:00:43.673
"I do!" Ethan said.

11
00:00:43.674 --> 00:00:48.169
"Let's play something all together," Miss Shelly said.

12
00:00:48.170 --> 00:00:52.242
"Uh, I brought something everyone can play."

13
00:00:52.243 --> 00:00:55.134
Jason's cheeks turned pink.

14
00:00:55.135 --> 00:00:58.328
"Is it Knights' Quest?" Bobby asked.

15
00:00:58.329 --> 00:01:00.451
Jason shook his head.

16
00:01:00.452 --> 00:01:04.734
"I don't think you've heard of this game. I made it up."

17
00:01:04.735 --> 00:01:09.019
"What's it called?" Izzie asked.

18
00:01:09.020 --> 00:01:11.895
"Zoom dreidel."

19
00:01:11.896 --> 00:01:16.102
"A dreidel is a top, right?" Ethan said.

20
00:01:16.103 --> 00:01:19.496
"Yep. It's a spinning top," Jason said.

21
00:01:19.497 --> 00:01:23.426
"Dreidel is also the name of a traditional Hanukkah game."

22
00:01:23.427 --> 00:01:28.416
"You invented zoom dreidel?" Miss Shelly asked.

23
00:01:28.417 --> 00:01:32.235
Jason nodded. "My dad is away on a business trip.

24
00:01:32.343 --> 00:01:35.416
I want to surprise him with a new game when he gets back."

25
00:01:35.417 --> 00:01:38.069
"Cool," Izzie said.

26
00:01:38.070 --> 00:01:41.614
"Can you teach us how to play?" Miss Shelly asked.

27
00:01:41.615 --> 00:01:45.721
"Sure." Jason set up the game board.

28
00:01:45.722 --> 00:01:49.862
There were six dreidels with letters written on all four sides.

29
00:01:49.863 --> 00:01:53.263
He also had game pieces and chocolate coins.

30
00:01:53.264 --> 00:01:57.677
"Did you make the board yourself?" Nina asked.

31
00:01:57.678 --> 00:02:03.521
"Yes. And I changed the dreidel rules to make the game go faster," Jason said.

32
00:02:03.522 --> 00:02:06.700
"Regular dreidel is slow sometimes."

33
00:02:06.701 --> 00:02:10.120
He gave everyone eight gold coins.

34
00:02:10.121 --> 00:02:12.904
"We call these coins 'gelt.'

35
00:02:12.905 --> 00:02:14.782
It means 'money.'

36
00:02:14.783 --> 00:02:18.297
Everyone, choose a dreidel and a game piece."

37
00:02:18.298 --> 00:02:20.766
Izzie took the green dreidel.

38
00:02:20.767 --> 00:02:24.002
"This reminds me of Gurpy."

39
00:02:24.003 --> 00:02:28.680
The others chose their dreidels, leaving the purple one for Nina.

40
00:02:28.681 --> 00:02:31.530
"Thanks, everybody," she said.

41
00:02:31.531 --> 00:02:35.513
"Each dreidel has Hebrew letters," Jason said.

42
00:02:35.514 --> 00:02:37.921
"I'll explain as we play.

43
00:02:37.922 --> 00:02:41.703
First we each put one coin in the center of the board.

44
00:02:41.704 --> 00:02:44.991
That's the pot. I'll go first."

45
00:02:44.992 --> 00:02:47.939
Jason spun his dreidel.

46
00:02:47.940 --> 00:02:50.707
It finally landed on one side.

47
00:02:50.708 --> 00:02:53.102
Jason looked at the letter.

48
00:02:53.103 --> 00:02:57.691
"I got nun. That means I don't do anything."

49
00:02:57.692 --> 00:03:02.784
Nina spun her dreidel next.

50
00:03:02.785 --> 00:03:04.642
"You got shin, Nina.

51
00:03:04.643 --> 00:03:08.795
Add a coin to the pot, and move back three spaces."

52
00:03:08.796 --> 00:03:13.765
Nina groaned and backed up her piece.

53
00:03:13.766 --> 00:03:17.889
"What's this letter?" Izzie pointed to gimel.

54
00:03:17.890 --> 00:03:20.600
"It's the best one!" Jason said.

55
00:03:20.601 --> 00:03:24.539
"You get to move ten spaces and take the whole pot!"

56
00:03:24.540 --> 00:03:29.403
"That's the letter I want!" Bobby spun his dreidel hard.

57
00:03:29.404 --> 00:03:34.757
It spun . . . and spun . . . and finally landed on hey.

58
00:03:34.758 --> 00:03:39.809
"Move five spaces and take half the pot," Jason said.

59
00:03:39.810 --> 00:03:44.338
Bobby laughed and grabbed some coins.

60
00:03:44.339 --> 00:03:47.116
"That's half as good!"

61
00:03:47.117 --> 00:03:51.087
"How does the game end?" Miss Shelly asked.

62
00:03:51.088 --> 00:03:55.758
"The first player to land on the last square is the winner," Jason said.

63
00:03:55.759 --> 00:03:59.607
"That player gets all the gelt."

64
00:03:59.608 --> 00:04:03.647
"This is better than Land of Candy," Izzie said.

65
00:04:03.648 --> 00:04:07.846
"We actually get to eat candy!"

66
00:04:07.847 --> 00:04:12.296
"Only the winner does," Bobby said.

67
00:04:12.297 --> 00:04:17.880
"Well, if I win, I'll share my gelt," Nina said.

68
00:04:17.881 --> 00:04:19.854
Jason smiled.

69
00:04:19.855 --> 00:04:22.889
"That's just what you're supposed to do during Hanukkah.

70
00:04:22.890 --> 00:04:27.280
Share gifts with friends and family members!"
